{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ROM","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"罗马书","commonName":"罗马书","title":"罗马书","order":45,"numberOfChapters":16,"sha256":"f17302e149fed1e38f90b58a032375190a256d10c3b29f06d530401a01210ee2","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ROM/1.json","lastChapterNumber":16,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ROM/16.json","totalNumberOfVerses":431},"chapter":{"number":10,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["弟兄姊妹，我心里切望并向上帝祈求的，就是以色列人能够得救。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["我可以作证：他们对上帝有热心，但不是基于真知。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["因为他们不知道上帝的义，想努力建立自己的义，不肯服从上帝的义。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["其实基督是律法的终极目的，使所有相信的人都可以得到义。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["求告主名的都必得救"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["关于律法的义，摩西写道：“遵行律法的人必因此而活。”",{"noteId":35}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["但是关于以信心为本的义，圣经上说：“不要心里说，‘谁要升到天上去呢？’",{"noteId":36},"意思是谁要把基督领下来，"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["或说，‘谁要下到阴间去呢？’",{"noteId":37},"意思是谁要把基督从死人中领上来。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["其实这里是说：“这话语近在咫尺，就在你口里，在你心中。”",{"noteId":38},"这话语就是我们所传的信主之道。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["你若口里承认耶稣是主，心里相信上帝使祂从死里复活，就必得救。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["因为人心里相信就可以被称为义人，口里承认就可以得救。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["圣经上说：“信靠祂的人必不会蒙羞。”",{"noteId":39}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["犹太人和希腊人并没有分别，主是所有人的主，祂厚待所有求告祂的人，"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["因为“凡求告主名的人都必得救”",{"noteId":40},"。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["可是，人还没信祂，怎能求告祂呢？还没听说过祂，怎能信祂呢？没有人传道，怎能听说过祂呢？"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["人没有受差遣，怎能传道呢？正如圣经上说：“那传福音之人的脚踪是何等佳美！”",{"noteId":41}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["只是并非人人都信福音，就像以赛亚先知所说的：“主啊！谁相信我们所传的呢？”",{"noteId":42}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["由此可见，听了道，才会信道；有了基督的话，才有道可听。"]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":["但我要问，以色列人没有听过吗？当然听过。因为",{"text":"“他们的声音传遍天下，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们的话语传到地极。”","poem":1},{"noteId":43}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":["我再问，难道以色列人不知道吗？首先，摩西说：",{"text":"“我要借无名之民挑起你们的嫉妒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用愚昧的国民激起你们的怒气。”","poem":1},{"noteId":44}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":["后来，以赛亚先知又放胆地说：",{"text":"“我让没有寻找我的人寻见，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我向没有求问我的人显现。”","poem":1},{"noteId":45}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":["至于以色列人，他说：",{"text":"“我整天伸出双手招呼那悖逆顽固的子民。”","poem":1},{"noteId":46}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":35,"caller":"+","text":"利未记18:5。","reference":{"chapter":10,"verse":5}},{"noteId":36,"caller":"+","text":"申命记30:12。","reference":{"chapter":10,"verse":6}},{"noteId":37,"caller":"+","text":"申命记30:13。","reference":{"chapter":10,"verse":7}},{"noteId":38,"caller":"+","text":"申命记30:14。","reference":{"chapter":10,"verse":8}},{"noteId":39,"caller":"+","text":"以赛亚书28:16。","reference":{"chapter":10,"verse":11}},{"noteId":40,"caller":"+","text":"约珥书2:32。","reference":{"chapter":10,"verse":13}},{"noteId":41,"caller":"+","text":"以赛亚书52:7。","reference":{"chapter":10,"verse":15}},{"noteId":42,"caller":"+","text":"以赛亚书53:1。","reference":{"chapter":10,"verse":16}},{"noteId":43,"caller":"+","text":"诗篇19:4。","reference":{"chapter":10,"verse":18}},{"noteId":44,"caller":"+","text":"申命记32:21。","reference":{"chapter":10,"verse":19}},{"noteId":45,"caller":"+","text":"以赛亚书65:1。","reference":{"chapter":10,"verse":20}},{"noteId":46,"caller":"+","text":"以赛亚书65:2。","reference":{"chapter":10,"verse":21}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ROM/10.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ROM/11.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ROM/9.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":21}